<title>FINLAND: Finnish Sept jobless rate falls to 16.7 percent.</title>
<headline>Finnish Sept jobless rate falls to 16.7 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's jobless rate fell to 16.7 percent in September from 17.2 percent in August, the Labour Ministry said in its monthly employment survey on Wednesday.</p>
<p>			 Sept 1996    Aug 1996	Sept 1995</p>
<p>    Unemployed     426,705	439,572	 452,102</p>
<p>    Jobless rate    16.7	   17.2	    17.9</p>
<p>The mean of six economists' forecasts for the September jobless rate measured by the labour ministry was 17.0 percent. The ministry's data is not used in international comparisons.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsrooom +358 - 0 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
